SY_TALK("eu0UE03zMog",[[0,["Mother is one being on this earth"]],[4,["who can actually give that Self-realization,"]],[7,["who can actually give you that enlightenment."]],[10,["No sitting in little rooms doing"]],[13,["strange positions for months on end,"]],[17,["to purify yourself and get yourself to some higher plain,"]],[20,["no sitting down, repeating mantras endlessly on the hope that"]],[24,["maybe one day you will reach some other state of consciousness,"]],[29,["or some other higher stage of development, evolution."]],[33,["Mataji can give you that realization this evening."]],[39,["The only prerequisite is the desire for it"]],[43,["and humility within yourself to be able to ask Her for it."]],[49,["I'll explain a little bit about this picture."]],[55,["As you'll see there are one, two, three, four, five, six, seven"]],[60,["different major centers marked in the diagram."]],[65,["They represent what we call chakras,"]],[72,["which are energy centers within the spinal column."]],[78,["Now they are not things that you can carve open a spine"]],[80,["and see within them, they are"]],[82,["subtle energy centers, in the same way"]],[84,["that you can't pull a television set apart and see the picture."]],[88,["They're there, they exist, they affect our behaviour,"]],[94,["our behaviour affects them, too, just as importantly."]],[99,["They have been with us all the time, they are part of our absolute,"]],[107,["inner structure, they are part of our absolute being."]],[112,["When a person is in the presence"]],[117,["of a realized soul,"]],[120,["such as Mataji Nirmala Devi, a process can occur,"]],[126,["whereby the Kundalini, which is, if you like it's that"]],[131,["tiny first energy that is created,"]],[135,["and is placed within each living entity."]],[138,["And the Kundalini resides,"]],[140,["in that triangiular area there, which is in us, the sacrum,"]],[145,["the coccyx, that bone right at the bottom of the spine,"]],[149,["that is where that energy resides."]],[152,["I don't know if you are aware of it, but"]],[158,["the actual word itself, sacrum,"]],[161,["means, is from the same root structure as the word sacred,"]],[165,["it's I mean, the very fact that that is the word we call it,"]],[169,["means that somewhere back in our"]],[172,["in our history, we knew"]],[173,["that there was something very special about that particular bone."]],[178,["The Kundalini energy resides in there and"]],[182,["another thing about that bone is, if a person say is burned,"]],[186,["that is the bone that remains right until the last,"]],[190,["it's the last bone to burn."]],[192,["It's just a quality about it, that it's very special."]],[196,["The Kundalini resides there"]],[198,["and that is the energy which when awakened"]],[202,["travels up through the different centers,"]],[207,["all the way up through the spinal column itself and"]],[211,["eventually when what we call enlightenment occurs,"]],[214,["that energy actually comes out through the top of our heads."]],[220,["It might sound a little strange but you can feel that energy,"]],[224,["and hopefully you'll all be able to feel it this evening."]],[229,["And you can feel it as a cool breeze."]],[232,["Now, you know,"]],[233,["some people actually feel it like there's a little fan sitting"]],[237,["on top of their head blowing a little jet of cool air out there."]],[240,["It happens."]],[241,["You can't explain it in physical terms,"]],[244,["it's an actual event, it actually occurs."]],[248,["You can also feel this coolness across your palms."]],[253,["You may have heard of the breath of the Holy Spirit."]],[259,["That is what the cool breeze is."]],[261,["The Indians have a word for it,"]],[264,["called 'chaitanya', which again is a cool breeze."]],[269,["The Middle Eastern people have a word for it, it's called the 'ruh',"]],[274,["it is the cool breeze."]],[276,["It's a thing that unfortunately we in the West"]],[280,["haven't heard all that much about"]],[282,["because our pursuits over the last"]],[285,["couple of thousands years have been basically material,"]],[289,["whereas in a lot of other cultures, in a lot of other countries,"]],[293,["the thing behind people's lives"]],[296,["isn't what material things they may own or may aquire or"]],[301,["what intellectual pursuits they may follow. It is"]],[304,["whether or not they are or can be connected with that"]],[309,["primordial energy and that total energy which some people call God,"]],[313,["some people call the Spirit, whatever name you want to call it."]],[318,["Some cultures in the world are for years being trying to get"]],[321,["themselves aligned with that Spirit, aligned with that energy."]],[326,["We in the West have steered ourselves way away from there."]],[330,["However, obviously, there's plenty of people here,"]],[334,["who want to know a little more about it and want if they can to be"]],[338,["reconnected, cause it's what we all came for in the first place,"]],[343,["with that energy."]],[345,["Now the way that Kundalini works"]],[347,["is that first,"]],[350,["it has to be awakened by"]],[354,["the energies first in that,"]],[358,["a little red four petaled chakra,"]],[361,["at the base there; it gives permission to the Kundalini or gives,"]],[367,["gives notice to the Kundalini, that"]],[369,["now is the time for it to be awakened."]],[373,["It stirs and passes up through..."]],[377,["The first chakra by the way, is called the Mooladhara chakra."]],[381,["Mooladhara means the root,"]],[385,["the support of the root,"]],[388,["all right? It's the actual thing that holds it, all"]],[391,["the whole thing rests on, the whole thing has to grow out from."]],[398,["I'll explain right from the beginning too,"]],[400,["that another thing that occurs as the Kundalini awakens is"]],[404,["you can actually, if you have a problem within yourself you can"]],[408,["find out where it is and do something about it"]],[411,["because as you can see the colours correspond with colours"]],[415,["we have drawn on the hands."]],[416,["You'll have to forgive us, in that all of the colours"]],[420,["in the diagram aren't the correct ones for the"]],[423,["actual chakras themselves, for the energy centers themselves."]],[427,["They've, we've, the chart was done in a little ignorance."]],[431,["We've since learned out how to correct it but we haven't quite"]],[435,["finished doing it at the moment. However you get"]],[437,["the correspondance from the colours and as you can see this spot"]],[441,["here, on the hand, is the same colour as that spot at the base"]],[446,["of the spine which is the Mooladhara and if you hold your hands out,"]],[451,["to Mataji for instance, you may feel a numbness or a tingling"]],[457,["or something in the base of your palm,"]],[460,["which means that there is some problem in that particular chakra"]],[466,["within your own subtle body and you can, if you have some problem,"]],[470,["you can proceed to do something about it and get rid of them."]],[475,["The Kundalini does the work for you. It gets rid of the problems."]],[478,["You just have to have it awakened and it starts to take care of you."]],[482,["It is as it were your own mother,"]],[485,["it has loved you since the beginning of creation and we'll take,"]],[489,["you know, now that you have the chance for it to be awakened within you"]],[492,["it will, it will quite, you will notice,"]],[497,["right from the beginning that it will start to look after you,"]],[500,["that there is this energy there that can take care of you on"]],[503,["many, many, many levels."]],[506,["The Kundalini energy awakens, from the Mooladhara"]],[509,["it goes up to that green center in the middle there first,"]],[515,["which we call the Nabhi chakra."]],[518,["Nabhi means navel. It is the chakra that is"]],[521,["behind the navel in the body. It has to do with..."]],[525,["They, they all have different qualities, all the chakras. This,"]],[529,["the particular quality of the Nabhi chakra is"]],[532,["to do with our sustenance, to do with our,"]],[535,["what we could call our dharma, the way we live."]],[541,["I mean it's, say for instance, a man drinks very heavily,"]],[547,["gambles a lot, goes out with a lot of different women,"]],[553,["indulges in different drugs perhaps. Any, any of those things,"]],[558,["they are not things that are going to destroy you"]],[560,["but they are things that they are going to make it harder for you to"]],[565,["live a balanced life within yourself."]],[568,["And that has to do with this center here, with the Nabhi,"]],[572,["with the dharma of the person."]],[573,["As the Kundalini awakens, it goes to that center and"]],[576,["as it gets enlightened, those qualities of dharma -"]],[581,["the Indian word \"dharma\", we can call it right living,"]],[584,["I think we might have heard of that term - whatever term we use,"]],[588,["that is the quality that comes from there"]],[590,["and as the Kundalini passes through there and awakens that center,"]],[594,["those qualities can start to come out in our own life."]],[597,["Then it drops back down to the orange coloured"]],[600,["center there which we call the Swadhisthan."]],[604,["It has to do with creativity ..."]],[607,["as an artistic activity,"]],[611,["and it also as you can see is the beginning of that yellow line,"]],[617,["all right?  Now that yellow line is one we use to denote"]],[622,["what is called the right hand sympathetic nervous system. All right?"]],[626,["Now we all have heard about the sympathetic nervous system."]],[630,["We have, on the diagram there, you'll see the yellow line,"]],[633,["the white line and the blue line. The yellow line,"]],[635,["is the right side sympathetic nervous system. It has to do with"]],[639,["activity, with the future, with planning, with"]],[647,["the ego eventually. As you can see it passes all the way through,"]],[650,["right up until it actually crosses over this center here,"]],[655,["and ends up on this section of the head here,"]],[659,["which is where what"]],[661,["we call ego resides."]],[665,["It's a thing we've all got, it's a thing that's been necessary"]],[669,["to us to have, to get to the stage of development"]],[672,["that we have reached, internally."]],[674,["I mean we have been involved in a growth process,"]],[678,["in a, in an evolutionary process,"]],[680,["that's finally brought us to the stage we are now:"]],[684,["Mental capacities have grown,"]],[686,["we have our physical capacities evolved,"]],[689,["you know, we slowly evolved to the point we are now."]],[692,["We are at the purple coloured center there which we call"]],[696,["the Sahasrar, which is when the human being"]],[701,["is evolved that stage,"]],[704,["it is possible for that chakra to be opened."]],[707,["And it is at that point"]],[709,["that the connection with the All Pervading occurs, with"]],[713,["the Divine, the connection with the Divine occurs."]],[717,["It happens at that center and to get there we have to"]],[721,["go all the way through all of the chakras, right?"]],[724,["So we go from the Swadisthan, the active principle there,"]],[729,["the creative side, and from the Swadhisthan,"]],[732,["we pass across that large green area, which is the Void,"]],[737,["we could call it the ocean of illusion,"]],[739,["if you like. It's all of the things that are around us all the time,"]],[742,["and trying to distract us,"]],[743,["all the things that are taking our attention away from"]],[747,["what we really are, what we are really seeking,"]],[750,["all of those things. And as we evolve, as we sort of discard,"]],[754,["all of the different divertions, you know, you may follow one path"]],[758,["for years and years and years and finally after"]],[761,["getting an extremly bitter taste in your mouth, eventually"]],[763,["you think, \"All right. I've had enough of that one."]],[765,["It hasn't reached me what I wanted,"]],[767,["I'm going to try something else\"."]],[770,["Now we do that not just for one or two years"]],[773,["but we do that for lifetime, after lifetime, after lifetime,"]],[777,["to the point where we finally sort ourselves out"]],[779,["and to the point where we finally get to where you are now"]],[784,["which is coming to a meeting hopefully"]],[788,["to find something out about Kundalini hopefully,"]],[791,["to gain enlightenment, which is the thing that we are all seeking,"]],[795,["it's the thing we have all -"]],[796,["that has been driving us right from the beginning of creation"]],[800,["that's what it´s about, you know."]],[801,["In the same way that the destiny of a tree is to flower,"]],[806,["bear fruit, and keep on growing. Our destiny is to flower,"]],[810,["bear fruit and keep on growing into Spiritual human beings which is,"]],[816,["when Jesus spoke of the kingdom of heaven on earth,"]],[820,["that's what in fact He was talking about, it's when,"]],[824,["not in some strange after life but when we actually"]],[828,["dwelled with God, if you call it God, on earth."]],[833,["Now that's something that is possible,"]],[835,["it is something that is promised."]],[837,["I mean not just one culture but"]],[840,["you know, culture after culture, after culture,"]],[844,["guru after guru, after guru, teacher after teacher,"]],[847,["has promised that at some stage in the human development,"]],[851,["it would be possible for that connection with the Spirit to occur,"]],[855,["that it would be possible to live with the Divine on earth."]],[860,["It was the promise of Jesus Christ, Mohammed spoke of it,"]],[864,["Buddha spoke of it. Buddha didn't speak of the Divine. He spoke of"]],[869,["the One, He spoke of, you know, freedom from all of the toils and"]],[874,["troubles but it's the same process. Buddha we actually find-"]],[879,["is the ruler of that yellow section in the top of the head,"]],[883,["of the ego."]],[885,["He grew to show us that development."]],[889,["Jesus Christ by the way resides in the center,"]],[894,["in what we call the Agnya chakra. I'll go back down to"]],[898,["the large green, or where we have the three green dots"]],[902,["in the center there, that is the Heart chakra, where the heart is,"]],[906,["Anahat, as some people call it, cause of the sound Anahat"]],[910,["is like the sound of the heart."]],[914,["That is where the Spirit resides - within the heart."]],[919,["I mean we can't feel joy, we can't feel love,"]],[923,["we can't, you know, they are all qualities of the heart."]],[927,["And eventually the thing we have to realize and eventually"]],[932,["the thing we discover is that God is love"]],[937,["and that that love is what is behind absolutely everything,"]],[942,["absolutely it is the, it is the thing out of"]],[946,["which the whole of creation has grown, is that love, and we all have"]],[951,["a tiny bit of that within us,"]],[954,["actually it resides in our heart."]],[959,["If the heart stops, the life stops. It's where it is."]],[963,["Now what happens, is as the Kundalini rises it awakens that center"]],[969,["again we have the next center, the Vishuddhi chakra."]],[973,["That has to do with communication,"]],[977,["with our self esteem, with -"]],[984,["it's sort of where we finally get to be human too"]],[987,["in a lot of ways. It's this center here and that chakra was opened"]],[992,["at the stage when the human being"]],[995,["grew from the ape, who had his head bowed,"]],[999,["to the man who had his head raised."]],[1002,["It's a very, very important stage in our evolution,"]],[1007,["it's you know, it may seem only a little thing on one level but"]],[1012,["to actually it's the break from being an animal to being a human"]],[1016,["occurs at that point. And it is that point"]],[1019,["that we start to communicate where we have words, where we have"]],[1024,["gestures, where we have facial expressions,"]],[1027,["all of those things actually start to operate from this chakra here,"]],[1031,["the Vishuddhi chakra."]],[1033,["And the Kundalini passes through there,"]],[1035,["and to the - what's called the Agnya chakra."]],[1038,["Some people might call it the 'third eye'."]],[1042,["It is a third eye in a sense but it's an inward looking eye,"]],[1045,["that's not one that you look out through."]],[1050,["It is where Jesus Christ resides."]],[1053,["When we have the words of Christ,"]],[1058,["that \"You must pass through Me to get to My Father\","]],[1063,["that is precisely what He is talking about."]],[1066,["You have to pass through that center."]],[1068,["You have to get as it were the \"o.k.\""]],[1071,["from Jesus that you may pass, that the Kundalini energy may pass"]],[1076,["through there and may pass into the Sahasrara, where,"]],[1081,["this center, the crown, will open and connect you"]],[1088,["with the Divine."]],[1091,["The quality of that chakra,"]],[1094,["one we tend to forget in the so-called christian countries,"]],[1099,["is the quality of forgiveness."]],[1102,["I don't think we can have any greater lesson"]],[1106,["than that of Jesus, the Lord Himself,"]],[1110,["as He was being crucified, saying,"]],[1113,["\"Forgive them, Father, for they know not what they do\"."]],[1116,["I mean, there He was, was the most powerful being in creation"]],[1121,["who could have.. who could have destroyed"]],[1125,["everyone and everything. He was there,"]],[1128,["begging His Father that His murderers be forgiven,"]],[1134,["and it's an incredible thing, it's, you know, I mean, a human being"]],[1138,["can only ever aspire to that wisdom and to that absolute love,"]],[1144,["cause that's what it came from when He said that."]],[1148,["And that is the quality of the Agnya chakra."]],[1154,["People may find,"]],[1156,["they get headaches a lot, that they worry a lot,"]],[1161,["that there's a whole lot of mental activity."]],[1163,["Anything to do with this center here,"]],[1166,["tends to pass, if somewhere within yourself you can find out"]],[1172,["who it is that you haven't forgiven."]],[1174,["Might be yourself, you know,"]],[1176,["you might be incredibly hard on yourself."]],[1178,["One of the hardest things to do is to forgive yourself,"]],[1180,["for all of the things that you feel you may or may not have done."]],[1183,["Is to turn around and say, \"o.k., you are forgiven\" , you know ..."]],[1188,["end of it. And as that quality of forgiveness starts"]],[1192,["to come into our own lives, the Agnya chakra itself,"]],[1196,["begins to work more fully and to give its blessings to us."]],[1201,["At the Sahasrar, what is called the thousand petalled lotus"]],[1207,["in Indian religious teaching,"]],[1212,["is where all of the qualities of all of the chakras"]],[1216,["are merged into one, and our balance starts."]],[1222,["There actually,"]],[1226,["each particular center as it were, has its seats"]],[1230,["on the actual head itself"]],[1234,["and they all move up to actually like,"]],[1238,["not like the United Nations but"]],[1241,["they all converge in the one area"]],[1244,["and can govern your life from there,"]],[1247,["with peace and freedom."]],[1252,["You'll see, I've spoken about the yellow side, the right hand side -"]],[1258,["ah, here is Mother, Mother, Mataji now. She will speak with us."]],[1270,["So go ahead. I'll speak after."]],[1275,["I was just about to speak about the left hand side."]],[1284,["It is the side of the past,"]],[1287,["of our memories, of our conditioning,"]],[1292,["of why we look back at all the things that we used to do and"]],[1295,["think about why can't we be like that now, all of those things."]],[1299,["They are things, qualities, on the left hand side."]],[1304,["Now, we can dissapear right out in the left hand side,"]],[1308,["into what's called the subconscious,"]],[1311,["into what's called the collective subconscious."]],[1313,["We are not only dealing with our past,"]],[1315,["we are dealing with the past of many, many, many people."]],[1318,["And we can get very lost in that area."]],[1321,["In the same way that when we go too far on the other side,"]],[1324,["on the right hand side, into the future."]],[1326,["We get into the areas where again we lose control,"]],[1331,["where we, we don't know who we are,"]],[1333,["where we get joined in with all of the egos and all of the futures"]],[1338,["of many, many, many other people, aside from ourselves, and we can"]],[1343,["what we call the supraconscious, the collective supraconscious,"]],[1346,["we can get lost into that area also."]],[1349,["However,"]],[1350,["as you can see there is that pure line up through the center,"]],[1353,["which is the central nervous system,"]],[1355,["the parasympathetic nervous system,"]],[1357,["which is where the Kundalini will pass,"]],[1361,["and where that energy can bring us back towards the center,"]],[1364,["bring us back towards the point,"]],[1367,["where finally it will pass through all the chakras"]],[1369,["and through the Sahasrar, giving us enlightenment"]],[1373,["and giving us the union with the Divine,"]],[1375,["which is what we are seeking, Mother."]],[1387,["Ladies and gentlemen, I have great pleasure in introducing to you,"]],[1391,["Shri Mataji Nirmala Devi. She has come to Melbourne,"]],[1396,["and I think probably the most important thing that,"]],[1400,["at a material level that She's managed to bring for all of us"]],[1402,["is this beautiful rain."]],[1405,["As She drove in from the airport today,"]],[1408,["somebody said to Her: \"Mother we need rain\", so"]],[1411,["She just put Her attention to it and"]],[1413,["the heaven seemed to have opened tonight."]],[1415,["But at the much more subtle level,"]],[1417,["She's able to give us far more as Bill has been saying,"]],[1420,["She's able to give us the experience of Self-realization."]],[1424,["We've come to that point in our evolution where we have to"]],[1427,["make that final ascent and become a higher being,"]],[1433,["a being which becomes one with God,"]],[1437,["a being which becomes a subtler being, which"]],[1441,["not only responds to those things,"]],[1444,["which we traditionally call our ego"]],[1448,["or our superego, which is really our subconscious,"]],[1450,["but we respond to the nature of the Spirit, which is eternal,"]],[1454,["but which is sleeping within us."]],[1457,["After Self-realization,"]],[1458,["this energy of Kundalini rises and with the Spirit,"]],[1465,["puts you in touch with the all pervading Spirit of God."]],[1469,["And at that moment when, it passes through the Sahasrar,"]],[1472,["this chakra at the top of the head, you become one with God."]],[1477,["You become a realized soul, you become a \"pir\","]],[1479,["as it refers to in the Muslim scriptures."]],[1483,["You become [pa] as it's said in the Hindu scriptures."]],[1488,["It's there and it happens, it's an experience."]],[1493,["And yet, one might ask why is it so easy and how do"]],[1496,["such a large number of people get it."]],[1499,["I've seen six thousand people get it in a meeting in India."]],[1503,["There are very few people here tonight but at some of the meetings,"]],[1506,["which Shri Mataji conducts,"]],[1509,["even in recently last night and the night before in Adelaide,"]],[1513,["three and four hundred at a time get their Self-realization."]],[1519,["It happens enmass because the grace of God is overflowing now."]],[1524,["And here on the earth is somebody who gives an enlightened light,"]],[1528,["who can give it freely, to everyone."]],[1532,["Just in Her presence the Kundalini awakens,"]],[1536,["just by merely stretching your hands out towards Her."]],[1539,["That subtlety that lies within you is awakened and all your seeking,"]],[1545,["over your many, many lives is rewarded at this moment."]],[1550,["You've been drawn here in a very, very, extraordinary way."]],[1556,["It's no accident that all of you are here tonight."]],[1561,["It's the reward of your seeking as I said. So,"]],[1565,["in a very humble way, but"]],[1567,["remaining scientific to the extent"]],[1569,["that you keep an open mind about it,"]],[1572,["I suggest that"]],[1574,["you listen to what Mataji has to say but more than that you,"]],[1578,["allow yourself to experience the cool vibrations,"]],[1582,["that were refer to in the Christian scriptures"]],[1584,["as the cool wind of the Holy Spirit,"]],[1587,["which Mohammed said would be flowing in the hands."]],[1591,["In fact he said, at this time of resurection, your hands will speak."]],[1598,["The Hindu scriptures, many, many of them have said it,"]],[1602,["Adi Shankaracharya in the sixth century, spoke very, very eloquently"]],[1609,["about the chaitanya, which again is this cool vibrations,"]],[1613,["which we feel on the hands,"]],[1615,["and which we feel coming from the top of the head."]],[1618,["So as Bill has explained the subtle centers within us,"]],[1622,["as he's explained the left side and"]],[1623,["the right side of our subtle body,"]],[1626,["in other words as he's explained the mechanism that lies within,"]],[1630,["now, really all that has to happen is, you have to get it."]],[1634,["And as you get it, you can give it to others."]],[1638,["This is the great joy of Self-realization,"]],[1642,["since the advent of Shri Mataji."]],[1645,["So when you get it, you should develop it,"]],[1650,["when you develop it you'll find that all your physical and emotional"]],[1654,["and mental problems will dissolve. But that's only a by-product."]],[1658,["And then of course you have to give it to others."]],[1661,["Because as you get the blessings of God, so too,"]],[1665,["those blessings must be given to others."]],[1668,["Sahaja Yoga is not a club, it's not a cult, it's not an organization"]],[1672,["and you certainly you can't pay any money for it."]],[1675,["And yet,"]],[1676,["quietly but very encouragingly it is growing throughout the world."]],[1682,["I have just arrived in Australia with Shri Mataji"]],[1685,["as part of a world tour that She is conducting this year,"]],[1689,["throughout England, the whole of Europe, South East Asia."]],[1692,["She's been through India along with about sixty of us,"]],[1697,["us - meaning the Australians, English, French, German, Italian,"]],[1702,["American, Canadian, all sort of nations have been"]],[1707,["with Her watching the miracle of Sahaja Yoga, spreading"]],[1710,["throughout India. But we are watching its spread towards the West,"]],[1714,["and it's catching on like wild fire."]],[1716,["Catching on meaning, people are getting their Self-realization and"]],[1720,["developing it, and becoming complete beings,"]],[1724,["getting their inner satisfaction, their inner joy,"]],[1729,["and knowing that they reached the goal"]],[1731,["that they've been seeking over their many lives."]],[1734,["Mataji is the wife of an eminent diplomat,"]],[1740,["he's the Secretary General of the United Nations Organizations,"]],[1744,["United Nations Organization, International Maritime Organization."]],[1750,["She's a housewife, She's a mother, She's a grandmother."]],[1756,["She's well-known as the daughter of the Salve family in India,"]],[1760,["who were freedom fighters of the time of Gandhi"]],[1764,["and that period when the British rule came to an end."]],[1768,["She's the sister of the Cabinet Minister"]],[1770,["in the Indira Gandhi government."]],[1774,["So She's very well-known at the international level but"]],[1778,["that level She plays down,"]],[1780,["that level She's not really so interested in."]],[1784,["That which She is interested in is the Spirit."]],[1787,["In Her very warm, in Her very loving, in Her very tender way,"]],[1793,["Her devotees, those people who gained their Self-realization,"]],[1800,["are those to whom She devotes Her greatest attention."]],[1804,["So, whether you know Her in person, in the physical sense,"]],[1810,["or whether you gain your Self-realization even from Her photograph,"]],[1814,["doesn't matter. Her blessings pour towards you"]],[1819,["and through you, and slowly you start"]],[1822,["to feel that bliss and that joy that have been spoken of"]],[1826,["so eloquently and so widely in all the scriptures."]],[1830,["It sounds too good to be true."]],[1832,["I must admit it sounds too good to be true."]],[1835,["So again I say, be open minded,"]],[1839,["even be scientific, keep it as a hypothesis at first."]],[1844,["See that you feel the cool wind."]],[1845,["Don't mistake it for the air conditioning."]],[1847,["It's a quite different coefficient."]],[1850,["You feel the cool vibrations over and through,"]],[1856,["and almost as if flowing through the body."]],[1860,["You feel it in a very, very subtle way."]],[1863,["Your ego will say, \"Is it the wind that's blowing"]],[1865,["from the air conditioner?\" It's not like that at all."]],[1869,["We've been in rooms which have been absolutely"]],[1871,["without air conditioning."]],[1873,["We've been in halls like this which are completely sealed."]],[1876,["It makes no difference."]],[1878,["But you have to feel those cool vibrations."]],[1881,["But if you don't feel it, don't be too dissapointed,"]],[1883,["because Shri Mataji will probably work on the centers a little,"]],[1889,["help to clear the centers a little,"]],[1891,["explain to you what might be the problem,"]],[1894,["and generally assist you, in the experience of Self-realization."]],[1899,["So without any further introduction from me,"]],[1902,["it gives me great pleasure to again introduce to you, in Melbourne,"]],[1906,["Her Holiness Shri Mataji Nirmala Devi."]],[1927,["I bow to all the seekers of truth."]],[1934,["We have to understand"]],[1937,["that God has created us as human beings with a purpose."]],[1944,["But in those modern times,"]],[1947,["when we don’t even believe in God,"]],[1949,["or on a, in a Creator, or any such energy that exists,"]],[1954,["it’s very hard to talk of God"]],[1956,["and to introduce"]],[1959,["Him to be the One who has made us human beings."]],[1963,["But even Darwin"]],[1967,["said that if man has come so far"]],[1971,["he will have to go a little further to understand himself."]],[1976,["I would suggest that"]],[1979,["one has to only understand one point,"]],[1982,["that whatever we have so far known"]],[1985,["has been the knowledge of the tree."]],[1989,["But we have to have the knowledge of the roots."]],[1995,["To get the knowledge of the roots,"]],[1998,["we have to become subtler than what we are."]],[2001,["This awareness, this human awareness, cannot take us that side."]],[2006,["For example, you are all listening to Me very intensely,"]],[2012,["but if I say “Please take your attention inside”,"]],[2016,["you’ll say “How? Mother it’s impossible.\""]],[2018,["'How do we take our attention inside?”"]],[2021,["It’s only possible when something happens within you"]],[2025,["that your attention is drawn inside,"]],[2029,["then only you will come to know"]],[2031,["that you are a beautiful instrument made through ages."]],[2037,["All these centres that are shown here represent"]],[2042,["your evolutionary process, one by one, how you evolved,"]],[2047,["through ages"]],[2049,["to this stage of evolution."]],[2054,["And now after evolving up to the human stage,"]],[2060,["what do we have to do?"]],[2063,["So we come to right conclusions about ourselves first of all,"]],[2068,["that we have to become something more,"]],[2071,["something has to happen to us."]],[2075,["Now so far in our evolution"]],[2077,["whatever has happened, has happened in our awareness,"]],[2082,["in Sanskrit called 'cheytana';"]],[2084,["means, a horse can go through a dirty lane,"]],[2091,["a dog can go through a dirty lane,"]],[2093,["but a human being cannot, he just can’t bear it."]],[2097,["He’ll vomit, he’ll refuse,"]],[2099,["he'll not accept at any cost to pass through something very filthy."]],[2104,["So our awareness towards dirt, filth, towards beauty,"]],[2110,["has definitely got a new dimension."]],[2114,["And this new dimension that we have got is not sufficient enough"]],[2119,["because still we have not understood why are we here,"]],[2123,["why all this has been done"]],[2126,["to create us into such a beautiful personality,"]],[2131,["what is the purpose of this creation."]],[2134,["And in this confusion only,"]],[2137,["we really fall into the traps of not understanding"]],[2143,["that there must be some power that does it."]],[2146,["It is very easy to deny the power of God"]],[2150,["because who is there to challenge it?"]],[2153,["Or who is going to say that \"How dare you deny?\""]],[2156,["Supposing you have a policeman, he is elected by you,"]],[2160,["so you cannot overthrow him, or you have to listen to him."]],[2165,["But God is not elected by you,"]],[2167,["He is appointed by Himself."]],[2170,["So as He is there you can always say whatever you like about Him."]],[2175,["But the same thing is to understand"]],[2179,["that actually human beings don't do any work which is living."]],[2184,["We cannot transform one flower into a fruit."]],[2189,["Even one."]],[2191,["What we do is to take some dead things, make buildings,"]],[2196,["make beautiful furniture, make these carpets, all manmade,"]],[2200,["every sort of thing, and then we start thinking, “Oh, we are great”."]],[2206,["Even the science can only find whatever is available"]],[2211,["or can be seen through these eyes or felt through these senses."]],[2216,["It cannot go beyond it, and even if it sometimes goes,"]],[2219,["like the auras and all that they see, they cannot explain it."]],[2224,["For example if, if there is any doctor they will understand"]],[2229,["that doctors are honest on this point,"]],[2231,["that acetylene and adrenaline,"]],[2235,["acetylcholine and adrenaline,"]],[2238,["two chemicals - which are chemicals, just chemicals -"]],[2243,["react differently in the body,"]],[2246,["and they say that the mode of action of these two,"]],[2250,["we cannot explain - why it is augmentation or why it is relaxation."]],[2255,["They admit it. So many things we have not been able to explain."]],[2261,["Now, if I say this is a beautiful instrument,"]],[2265,["and it is fantastic to believe that we are great,"]],[2270,["I would just give another simple example,"]],[2273,["that if you have to come to this room"]],[2277,["and there is no light, I just tell you,"]],[2279,["\"All right, push that button and you will get lights everywhere\"."]],[2283,["Now it happens! It becomes a fantastic thing"]],[2285,["for a person who has never seen electricity,"]],[2288,["who has never known anything, who has no knowledge of electricity,"]],[2291,["that only you press one button and you get it."]],[2293,["But behind all this organism,"]],[2296,["behind all this working, all that is done,"]],[2300,["there is a big history."]],[2302,["There are lots of people who have worked to achieve this."]],[2306,["People have sacrificed so much to achieve this,"]],[2309,["but we are taking the benefit of that"]],[2312,["as today we are enjoying electricity."]],[2314,["How many people must have died discovering it?"]],[2318,["How many people must have sacrificed their life"]],[2321,["for discovering the use of it for the masses?"]],[2325,["In the same way we must understand that"]],[2329,["maybe that we are something fantastic, reach a conclusion"]],[2334,["that we have to just feel it."]],[2339,["And unless and until you feel that greatness within you,"]],[2343,["you should not just deny that you can achieve it."]],[2347,["You have to achieve it!"]],[2349,["Actually, if you do not achieve it"]],[2351,["you will fall short of your evolution."]],[2355,["Today in the world if you see,"]],[2357,["everywhere I go there are so many seekers, so many seekers!"]],[2362,["Such a time was never there before, say about fifty years back"]],[2365,["we did not know the word “seekers”."]],[2368,["People did not believe that there are seekers,"]],[2370,["but today you find so many seekers all over the world."]],[2374,["They have gone to all kinds of other alternative things,"]],[2377,["they have tried to find out if they can find truth"]],[2381,["by altering their lives, by doing this or by doing that."]],[2385,["The reason is, they are not at all satisfied with what they see."]],[2389,["They are intelligent enough to see that it’s not the end"]],[2393,["of our lives and we don’t live just for insurances."]],[2398,["Now, then one starts thinking"]],[2401,["that if these are the seekers in this world,"]],[2403,["why so many have come on this earth?"]],[2407,["This is a special time, already predicted"]],[2410,["thousands and thousands of years back."]],[2413,["In every kind of prediction they have talked about it."]],[2418,["There was a book called 'Nadi Granth', written"]],[2421,["you can’t say how many years back, but was revised"]],[2423,["only three hundred years back by another person called Bhujander."]],[2428,["Now this Nadi Granth is written by a person"]],[2431,["who is actually the starting point of astrology in India,"]],[2436,["the one who started. The whole astrology has been started from India"]],[2440,["and this is the man, Bhrigu, who did it."]],[2443,["And he wrote this Nadi Granth in which he has described -"]],[2447,["according to him, he said it in Sanskrit language"]],[2450,["but was again translated and brought to up to date level,"]],[2454,["that in 1970 something will happen,"]],[2458,["a personality will come on this earth who will"]],[2462,["give realization to thousands of people by a sahaja method."]],[2466,["It’s clearly written down, you’ll be amazed to know that it is so,"]],[2470,["because we have a book,"]],[2471,["in that book all these prophecies are written."]],[2474,["And what will happen? The Kundalini will rise"]],[2478,["and people will get their realization."]],[2480,["To Indians, Kundalini is not a new knowledge."]],[2483,["Of course, there are some people who went from"]],[2488,["other countries and tried to study about Kundalini."]],[2493,["Now when such people come to India"]],[2496,["they do not reach the roots at all."]],[2499,["They are just caught up by people who want to make money out of them"]],[2502,["or to mislead them."]],[2504,["It’s a big market there for all such things."]],[2507,["And now when these people also came,"]],[2509,["specially the Germans, when they came to India,"]],[2512,["they were caught up into such mess"]],[2515,["and they were given books which were nothing but"]],[2518,["just the opposite of what Kundalini is."]],[2521,["It’s about the people who are doing tantrism."]],[2526,["And tantrism is a system in which people do anti-God activity."]],[2531,["With anti-God activity you get all kinds of"]],[2534,["horrible experiences of God and the Kundalini,"]],[2537,["and they have described all of them,"]],[2539,["as if they are the real effects of Kundalini."]],[2543,["It's like the knowledge of a naive villager coming"]],[2547,["and putting his hand into the holes of a plug"]],[2552,["and saying that electricity gives you a big shock."]],[2556,["So, it is even worse than that"]],[2558,["because Kundalini never gives you trouble."]],[2560,["She is your mother."]],[2562,["She is settled down here in the triangular bone, as you see,"]],[2565,["is called as 'sacrum'."]],[2568,["Now this sacrum bone is - sacrum means sacred."]],[2573,["And when I ask people,"]],[2575,["that how is it that this bone is called as sacred in Greek?"]],[2581,["When I went to Greece I asked the people,"]],[2583,["“Why do you call this a sacrum?”"]],[2585,["Then they told Me that they had a report long time back,"]],[2588,["before Alexander went to India,"]],[2592,["and there was a report between Indo-Aryan groups"]],[2595,["and they told that this bone should be called as 'sacrum'."]],[2599,["Now imagine that this bone specially"]],[2601,["should be called as sacrum and no other bone."]],[2604,["So this bone has got this three and a half coiled energy,"]],[2608,["settled down inside there."]],[2610,["Now, some of these books that I’ve read,"]],[2613,["such big books written on Kundalini -"]],[2615,["some of them say the Kundalini is here, somebody says in the nose,"]],[2618,["somebody says somewhere else -"]],[2620,["means they are just, just using the ignorance of people"]],[2624,["to print something, write something, and just mislead them,"]],[2628,["to make some money out of these books."]],[2630,["So far I’ve not written any book."]],[2632,["I am sorry, I’ve not yet done any of that work so far."]],[2635,["But anything can be written in the book."]],[2638,["Whatever is written in the book is not the truth"]],[2640,["and you should not accept it."]],[2642,["How much does it take to print a book?"]],[2644,["You people are living in such an advanced country."]],[2647,["You know it hardly takes anything to write a book about anything,"]],[2650,["especially about God and His work."]],[2652,["Because even, you'll be amazed that Hitler used to talk about God,"]],[2657,["Napoleon used to talk about God."]],[2659,["All these horrible people used to talk about God,"]],[2661,["and sometimes they believed that God was in their favour"]],[2664,["because they thought they were rather successful."]],[2668,["Now, these books or whatever they have told you, is not true."]],[2673,["This is the truth, that the Kundalini lies in your sacred bone,"]],[2678,["called sacrum."]],[2680,["You can see the pulsation of the Kundalini at the time"]],[2683,["when the Kundalini is raised. Not in everyone,"]],[2687,["if you have got a blockage"]],[2689,["in that another center that is there,"]],[2691,["or the upper, this centre, then this Kundalini - because"]],[2695,["this is the pure desire of becoming one with God."]],[2701,["This is the purest desire which you have"]],[2704,["and when it is awakened it makes an effort, a tremendous effort."]],[2710,["But I have seen some people have Kundalinis which are just hurt,"]],[2715,["like a beaten up snake, you see, it just tosses."]],[2721,["It tosses itself on all the sides and tries to get out"]],[2725,["but it cannot because the gentleman or the seeker"]],[2728,["who has got this Kundalini within himself, his own mother,"]],[2731,["has hurt Her so much that She cannot raise her head,"]],[2735,["she is very tired and she wants the supply of pure energy to rise."]],[2741,["So when people are here I have to tell you one thing, that"]],[2746,["it’s nice that you have come for realization, you should take it."]],[2751,["But you can’t demand it, you can’t demand it."]],[2754,["For today I found one gentleman was just shaking before Me like this."]],[2757,["All the time. So he said, “Why am I shaking before You?”"]],[2761,["I said, “Because your nerves are out. You are a nervous person."]],[2766,["That’s why you are shaking. All your nerves are out,"]],[2768,["I have to steady them, otherwise the Kundalini won’t rise"]],[2771,["and you won’t feel the cool breeze,"]],[2773,["because Kundalini is now attending to those nerve centers"]],[2777,["which are absolutely overdone."]],[2781,["They are absolutely fagged out and tired.\""]],[2783,["He is a young man, about twenty five years,"]],[2786,["I am an old woman, but I said, “Look at my hands, are not shaking."]],[2789,["Why should your hands shake like an old man"]],[2791,["of eighty years all the time? You must think about it.\""]],[2793,["Why should they think it should happen?"]],[2797,["So this is what it is, that some people get it."]],[2803,["Most of them get it. But some cannot get it."]],[2806,["Now the attitude should be little different"]],[2809,["from what you have towards anybody else."]],[2812,["Here you have to get something out of Me."]],[2816,["You have to make use of Me."]],[2819,["Not that I have to use you for any purpose whatsoever."]],[2823,["It should be clear cut that you are asking for something."]],[2828,["You deserve it, no doubt!"]],[2831,["It’s like you go to the bank, all right,"]],[2834,["there’s a banker sitting there."]],[2835,["If you have some money in the bank,"]],[2837,["you can go and talk to him but you can’t be rude with the banker."]],[2840,["You have to say, \"All right, I have got this money with you,"]],[2843,["please may I have?”"]],[2844,["Now the Grace of God is so gracious,"]],[2847,["that it gives you manifold much more"]],[2849,["than what you have really reserved in the bank."]],[2852,["I can see that working out so well."]],[2854,["So we have to understand that we are made in our own glory,"]],[2859,["God has made us a fantastic thing,"]],[2861,["we are a great instrument that has to receive it's blessings."]],[2867,["And as this instrument is put to the mains,"]],[2870,["once you put to your mains,"]],[2872,["you will be surprised how fantastic you are."]],[2876,["It’s amazing how people are not aware of themselves."]],[2880,["It is amazing how people do not know,"]],[2883,["how precious they are to the Divine."]],[2886,["Human beings are the epitome of this creation."]],[2890,["Forget the moon, forget the sun, forget this earth,"]],[2893,["everything is nothing, it’s at your feet."]],[2897,["You are the highest that God has created"]],[2899,["and the way we fritter away our life for nothing at all,"]],[2902,["for superficial things, is something very, very surprising."]],[2906,["We are not at all aware that how much the nature has worked for us,"]],[2911,["to make us human beings."]],[2913,["And once you realize that you are the Spirit -"]],[2917,["realize doesn’t mean"]],[2918,["that you just realize it through a mental process,"]],[2922,["it is a happening within you, which takes place. You become that!"]],[2926,["And once you become that, you’ll be amazed"]],[2930,["that your becoming will prove that you are really the epitome,"]],[2936,["you are the meaning, you are everything"]],[2939,["and without you, the creation has no meaning at all."]],[2943,["It’s like a tree which has now the flowers,"]],[2947,["and they have to become the fruits,"]],[2949,["otherwise the tree has no meaning at all."]],[2951,["But whatever we do mentally is artificial."]],[2957,["Because it has no roots attached to it,"]],[2962,["it has no moorings to it."]],[2964,["Now your, say your politics or your economics, all is artificial."]],[2969,["But in that also you can find a lot of truth."]],[2972,["For example, economics says that wants in general are not satiable."]],[2977,["Individual wants can be satisfied,"]],[2979,["but wants in general are not satiable,"]],[2982,["means this matter cannot give us satisfaction."]],[2986,["If it could then we would have been satisfied with one thing,"]],[2989,["but we buy one thing, then we buy, want to buy another thing"]],[2992,["and then we want to buy another thing and still we are"]],[2995,["the most dissatisfied souls ever living on this earth."]],[3000,["Now economics another, then politics we can see,"]],[3004,["is that people talk of say, communism, they talk of socialism,"]],[3010,["they talk of democracy, of capitalism."]],[3013,["It's also artificial to Me, it's just a play of human beings."]],[3017,["Because when you say you are a capitalist - what is your capital?"]],[3023,["This you can’t take with you. It's of no use."]],[3026,["You don’t want to share it. What's the use of such a capital?"]],[3028,["While I would say I am a capitalist"]],[3030,["because I have all the powers within Myself."]],[3033,["And I am the greatest communist"]],[3034,["because I can't live without sharing it. I just can’t help it."]],[3038,["You see, people can’t understand Me."]],[3039,["They think, \"You are a nicely married lady,"]],[3042,["your husband is such a nice person, is such a nice gentleman,"]],[3045,["he loves you so much, he cares for you so much."]],[3048,["You are a grandmother,you are a mother and why are You doing all this"]],[3051,["and running about everywhere, talking to people?"]],[3053,["They can’t understand this communism which is so important to Me"]],[3058,["that I cannot get My joy without sharing it with others."]],[3062,["It's something which people have to gradually take in"]],[3066,["and once they take in, they become themselves."]],[3069,["It’s my job that I have to give you what you have."]],[3072,["It’s your own. I do not do anything about it,"]],[3076,["it's your own. All you are built in that way."]],[3078,["Only thing what I do, like a candle which is enlightened"]],[3082,["can enlighten any other candle, which is ready."]],[3086,["But some people will escape saying, “I’m not ready”."]],[3088,["Now, you let Me find out if you are ready or not."]],[3091,["That’s another side of it."]],[3092,["“Mother, we are sinners, we are not ready.”"]],[3095,["Now you let Me do the job for you."]],[3097,["I may be able to put the candle right."]],[3099,["Why do you condemn yourself? This is the other side of it."]],[3103,["Sometimes people get into ego moods"]],[3105,["and sometimes they get into such a superego mood"]],[3107,["that they say,” Mother, oh we are no good, we are sinners,"]],[3111,["we have done this, we have done that.” Now forget it!"]],[3113,["If I don’t know the job then I better not do it."]],[3117,["But I think I know it, I have done it."]],[3119,["So let Me do it, and let us see if I can give what you have."]],[3123,["Because that is supposed to be God’s promise, that"]],[3127,["you have to get your resurrection,"]],[3129,["that you have to become self-realized, that you are to be born again"]],[3133,["and all this has been done within you with this aim"]],[3136,["and is not to be wasted."]],[3138,["I don’t know how many in Melbourne are going to get it."]],[3140,["How many are going to get it in Sydney, that’s besides the point."]],[3144,["It depends on how much you care for yourself."]],[3147,["But wherever I go I will try my level best to do it."]],[3152,["Now, how I cure people and what happens -"]],[3155,["actually curing is not at all My job,"]],[3158,["it's just a by-product by which you get cured completely."]],[3161,["Because once you get your absolute and you get to the source"]],[3166,["which is all pervading, which starts flowing through you,"]],[3171,["then your problem is solved."]],[3173,["You never get exhausted, you never get upset."]],[3176,["It’s all solved. The whole energy works it out."]],[3179,["So the compassion that people talk of"]],[3181,["that we are very compassionate"]],[3183,["and we are very peace loving and all that, is so superficial."]],[3186,["This is the compassion that it works."]],[3189,["It works, it doesn’t talk, it just works."]],[3192,["This is the peace that exists,"]],[3194,["that you feel is expressed within you and without."]],[3198,["A person of that calibre"]],[3200,["if he stays with other people who are turbulent,"]],[3203,["who are volcanic, who are violent,"]],[3207,["they become peaceful. It works.  That’s what it is."]],[3212,["You must know that whatever people are saying to you, it must work."]],[3217,["Like going to other gurus, to other people,"]],[3221,["you should know that it has not given you any power of your own."]],[3225,["Leave alone whatever they have to say about Me,"]],[3227,["I am this, I am that, I am that. Forget it."]],[3229,["What I am saying, what are you?"]],[3233,["You have to receive your own significance."]],[3236,["You have to understand your own meaning"]],[3239,["and if it works in you then it’s all right."]],[3242,["That’s what you should ask anyone if you go to and say that"]],[3247,["“Can you give me my own powers, not your powers?”"]],[3250,["You may be very great and you might be doing something."]],[3253,["But people are so ridiculously superficial,"]],[3256,["so ridiculously superficial that a person if he buys"]],[3259,["fifty-eight Rolls Royce out of the money of loots that they have,"]],[3263,["out of these people who go to them,"]],[3266,["we think “Oh, he has fifty-eight Rolls Royce.”"]],[3269,["He, such a man can impress these English"]],[3272,["who could not be impressed by anything else,"]],[3275,["if he has a big cavalcade or a big procession"]],[3278,["of these fifty-eight looted Rolls Royce on the road,"]],[3283,["then people say, “Oh! what a guru he is,"]],[3286,["he’s got fifty-eight Rolls Royce.”"]],[3288,["Yes, you won’t believe, and he wanted to have the fifty-ninth one."]],[3292,["And he went away to America."]],[3294,["And he wrote a letter saying that"]],[3295,["\"If you give me the fifty-ninth I’ll come\"."]],[3297,["The poor boys, you see,"]],[3300,["they suffered, they ate only potatoes, they starved themselves."]],[3304,["They have - they are fifty thousand still in U.K.,"]],[3307,["absolutely cabbages, lost people, absolutely lost."]],[3310,["You can’t talk to them. They shake when you go before them."]],[3313,["They can’t understand, it is all finished there,"]],[3315,["nothing, they are all lost people."]],[3318,["And if you go and tell them “How can you"]],[3320,["get a Rolls Royce for a sadhu? He's a sanyasi, he says."]],[3324,["How can you give him a Rolls Royce?”"]],[3326,["So they say, “We have got the Spirit”,"]],[3330,["means some spirit has possessed them, you see,"]],[3333,["“We have got the Spirit and we have to give just metal."]],[3337,["What is in Rolls Royce? Is metal.\""]],[3338,["But why don’t they think, why does the guru"]],[3342,["think that this metal is precious?"]],[3344,["You see, we don’t use our brains at all when you go to gurus,"]],[3347,["surprisingly. If he says, \"I will make you fly\"."]],[3350,["All right, at least you should ask the guru to fly."]],[3354,["Why not make him fly and see if he can fly or not."]],[3356,["At least minimum of minimum that he should do, isn’t it?"]],[3359,["But that also we never do, we just accept it."]],[3362,["Because he has a big organisation and he has a big publicity,"]],[3366,["because you can pass through seven rooms to reach him and all that."]],[3370,["He creates a feeling, and then you think “Oh, it’s great to fly”."]],[3373,["And if somebody says that, \"Go and ask that guru to fly\","]],[3377,["people don’t like it. They don’t want to hear anything about it."]],[3381,["And then you pay thousands and thousands of pounds to them."]],[3385,["You end up as penniless people, as epileptic people,"]],[3389,["and you can’t understand what wrong it was."]],[3391,["You didn’t use your brains!"]],[3394,["You didn’t use your brains I would say."]],[3397,["I know, I must condemn all these devilish people"]],[3399,["who have ruined so many seekers because they are seeking truth."]],[3402,["They are my children, they’re my own, I know."]],[3405,["I feel very sorry for them. You don’t know how much I want to work,"]],[3410,["that I should save all of them, but"]],[3412,["I also should tell you that this is your mistake, you misunderstand."]],[3417,["You don’t know that you can’t pay for your realization,"]],[3420,["you can’t pay for God."]],[3424,["Christ was bought for 30 rupees."]],[3427,["It's a very good example to understand."]],[3430,["He was bought to be killed."]],[3434,["Another example is that when people were selling some things"]],[3437,["in the temple, He took a big whip and whipped them,"]],[3442,["absolutely in a great temper. Who said on the cross, that"]],[3446,["“Please God forgive them for they do not know what they are doing.”"]],[3450,["But now it is so sad that if you do like that"]],[3456,["you won’t be able to forgive yourself."]],[3458,["Christ maybe, but you may not be able to forgive yourself"]],[3461,["for doing all these mistakes and committing such horrible injuries"]],[3467,["upon yourself and troubling your Kundalini to that extent."]],[3471,["This Self-realization you have been seeking for ages, many lives."]],[3477,["You have been seekers for many lives and the time has come,"]],[3481,["this great time of resurrection, the great time of your judgement."]],[3486,["At this time you should take it, take it up"]],[3489,["that you have to be self-realized! Only this is my message to you."]],[3494,["I hope you will understand it. May God bless you."]],[3499,["I would like you to ask Me some questions"]],[3502,["because today is the first day. But ask relevant questions."]],[3505,["Some people, you see, just ask questions just to show off."]],[3509,["Then I would say they should take another hall"]],[3511,["to give a lecture there. But normally -"]],[3516,["yes, some people start giving another lecture to Me, you see,"]],[3519,["and instead of My lecture, I have to listen to their lecture,"]],[3521,["which has no relevance to it, you see."]],[3523,["So I would request you not to waste others’ time. Be civil to them,"]],[3528,["and ask questions which are relevant to the subject."]],[3532,["Thank you very much."]],[3548,["Right. Any questions?"]],[3551,["Each night Mataji is going to be speaking here."]],[3553,["Keep the cane on one side."]],[3560,["Each night Mataji is going to be speaking here."]],[3562,["She’ll be talking tomorrow night about"]],[3565,["the centers that lie up to the heart,"]],[3569,["and the next night the centers that lie to the Sahasrara,"]],[3573,["in particular the chakra of the Sahasrara."]],[3577,["So, any particular questions about the individual centers within us,"]],[3582,["We can ask tomorrow.","she’ll be explaining on a day-by-day basis."]],[3586,["So any questions thus far?"]],[3590,["I'd like to know if having a vertebrae in the spine out of place"]],[3595,["interferes with the rising of the Kundalini?"]],[3598,["Does having a vertebrae out of place in the spine"]],[3601,["interfere with the rising of Kundalini?"]],[3603,["It does to some extent, it does."]],[3606,["Definitely it does, but we can put it right."]],[3608,["The vertebrae can be put right and the Kundalini can be brought in."]],[3611,["It does. So many things do happen, if you have -"]],[3614,["you are a person over read;"]],[3616,["if you have read too many books and the books are in your head,"]],[3619,["I have to empty that also."]],[3625,["I actually do this work as a profession and I find that"]],[3629,["if the subtle center is fixed, the spinal problems just disappear."]],[3635,["I used to have three and four adjustments a week,"]],[3638,["to correct my spine and now I have none at all."]],[3641,["So first fix the subtle within us and then the gross part,"]],[3646,["the spinal misalignments and so on, will just get better."]],[3654,["Any others?"]],[3661,["May I ask another question?","Yes."]],[3667,["Do you feel that there can be a difference between, in marriage,"]],[3673,["that people can be married on earth, in a seemingly holiness,"]],[3679,["that there is really a difference in a marriage of souls,"]],[3682,["than there is in many marriages, so-called marriages."]],[3688,["[...]"]],[3690,["I’m not too sure, but, earthly marriages which seem to be ok,"]],[3696,["but - did you saying a mismarriage of souls?"]],[3700,["Perhaps, but maybe there is some sort of"]],[3703,["mismarriage in some way of souls of those same people."]],[3707,["Can there be a perfectly “normal” - as we call it, earthly marriage,"]],[3711,["and perhaps a mismarriage of souls, in a heavenly sense?"]],[3718,["You see the Spirit in every being is perfect."]],[3723,["Everybody’s Spirit is perfect. There’s no imperfection with it."]],[3727,["But some people have a more reflection of the Spirit"]],[3731,["in their character, and some people don’t have."]],[3735,["They have more darkness and more we can say,"]],[3743,["outward look or materialistic you can call them,"]],[3747,["or you can call them, they are over-romantic type,"]],[3750,["any sort of thing which is outside. But doesn’t matter."]],[3754,["We have seen people who have been married before,"]],[3757,["they said they are mal-adjusted."]],[3759,["I would say ninety percent such marriages are now doing well."]],[3764,["But maybe, there could be terrible difference also"]],[3767,["between the two persons, as you say. It's possible."]],[3771,["But that is to be seen. Just now you should not worry about it."]],[3775,["If there is any mal-adjustment, it might be put right."]],[3778,["If it doesn’t work out"]],[3780,["then you have to work out the correction as far as possible."]],[3784,["See it is said 'Karmanye vadhikaraste',"]],[3787,["is that with which we can do the work."]],[3790,["We can work it out as far as possible."]],[3792,["But if it doesn’t work, forget it. That’s it."]],[3796,["But once you are a realised soul,"]],[3799,["you become so congenial, so tolerant, so understanding."]],[3804,["Actually your being itself corrects the other person."]],[3808,["But maybe some people can be such gone cases,"]],[3811,["that whatever you may try they may not come back."]],[3815,["So it's not important to worry about those things."]],[3818,["We’ll see later on how the thing is"]],[3820,["and how it has to be worked out, all right?"]],[3824,["Could You please explain more about the realization process"]],[3829,["when it comes out of the top of your head."]],[3831,["Could You explain Self-realization, and in particular"]],[3835,["how it manifests on your hands"]],[3836,["and how it comes out of the top of your head."]],[3840,["It just comes out."]],[3845,["You see, how will you explain"]],[3847,["how does a primule or the germ of a seed comes out?"]],[3851,["It’s like that, it’s a living process as I said."]],[3854,["The Kundalini rises and when She enlightens all other centers"]],[3858,["She passes through them and then when She comes up here,"]],[3862,["at this point, this point is very important in human beings,"]],[3865,["is bestowed or, we can say the -"]],[3869,["it is governed by the deity of Lord Jesus Christ."]],[3874,["And He sucks in these two institutions called ego and super-ego."]],[3879,["By that there’s an opening made and the Kundalini just"]],[3883,["jets out and you can feel it coming out of your head."]],[3886,["This is the actualisation of baptism. It’s not something artificial,"]],[3890,["that you take water and put it on somebody’s head and say that"]],[3894,["\"you are baptised\" and hear the child is screaming with that baptism."]],[3902,["So it’s an actualisation, it’s a living process, how it works."]],[3907,["But while rising of course lots of things happen, like the"]],[3913,["chakras go into various moods, they try to sustain the Kundalini,"]],[3918,["they try to keep it there. All these things happen."]],[3922,["These happen when the Kundalini is awakened, not before that."]],[3928,["That’s why, like somebody talks of Raja Yoga,"]],[3931,["that you cut your tongue, push it back and do the 'kechari'"]],[3935,["and by that you can raise your Kundalini. And it is absurd, you see."]],[3939,["Like the car has not started,"]],[3941,["so you move the wheels and the car will start."]],[3944,["But when the Kundalini is rising,"]],[3946,["this tongue is little bit pulled inside no doubt,"]],[3949,["automatically. You don’t feel it also."]],[3951,["Slightly it is pulled inside and is released again."]],[3953,["But by cutting this tongue and putting it back"]],[3956,["do you think the Kundalini will rise?"]],[3957,["It's so superficial, it’s so artificial."]],[3960,["And that’s how they have done all these things."]],[3962,["Even now, for example Hatha Yoga that we do,"]],[3965,["is -of course Hatha Yoga is ashtanga,"]],[3967,["it is not only one that we call as yoga, is standing on your head,"]],[3970,["It's not the only thing. It is ashtanga."]],[3973,["There are eight things and in that also, 'Ishvara pranidhana',"]],[3975,["means the establishment of God, is the first thing."]],[3979,["Because before the Kundalini has started"]],[3981,["if you start doing any exercises, you may be harming yourself."]],[3985,["Because you don’t know where is the problem."]],[3987,["Supposing you have a problem in the stomach"]],[3989,["and you are doing the exercises of the nose, what’s the use?"]],[3992,["You will spoil the nose as well as the stomach is already bad."]],[3996,["So it's very indiscriminate. It’s very scientific."]],[3999,["The mantras are the same thing. Where to say which mantras,"]],[4002,["what chakras are catching, which deity is to be awakened,"]],[4006,["we must know all the science behind it."]],[4008,["And everybody knows, there is no secret about it."]],[4011,["There is not the thing you come here inside,"]],[4013,["and you will pay Me three hundred pounds and I'll give you a mantra."]],[4016,["All right, that mantra you are not to tell anybody,"]],[4018,["because that mantra means nothing, you see."]],[4021,["There was a fellow who paid three hundred pounds,"]],[4023,["and I asked him what was the mantra. He said “tinga”."]],[4025,["Now if you tell an Indian he will just laugh,"]],[4027,["if he hears what it means, it means this."]],[4031,["Can you imagine such nonsense?"]],[4033,["And don’t tell anybody! It’s a big Mafia."]],[4036,["Don’t tell anybody, just keep quiet."]],[4038,["If you tell anybody, then - because you have found out."]],[4044,["So you cannot give one mantra. Is another funny idea people have"]],[4049,["that you just give one mantra to somebody."]],[4052,["Of course, I mean if you have a problem at a particular point"]],[4055,["one can say that, \"At this time you say this mantra to clear out\"."]],[4059,["But then later on you don’t go on with it."]],[4062,["Then you do the one which where you need, require. Isn’t it?"]],[4066,["I'ts simple as that. Supposing you are suffering from some trouble,"]],[4070,["we take medicine for that particular thing."]],[4072,["And then, when we are suffering from another trouble"]],[4074,["we take another medicine for that particular thing."]],[4077,["We don’t go on taking the same medicine, whether it is anything."]],[4081,["So it is a very scientific knowledge,"]],[4084,["which you will pick up in no time."]],[4085,["Eight days are sufficient to learn the whole of Sahaja Yoga."]],[4091,["Once you get your realisation, that’s the main point is."]],[4094,["Excuse me. Does meat eating interfere with all this?"]],[4099,["What is it?"]],[4101,["Does meat eating interfere with this process?"]],[4104,["No, not at all, not at all. But you see, you have to understand,"]],[4108,["what sort of a personality you are."]],[4111,["If you are the right sided personality then you should not eat meat,"]],[4114,["you should take to something milder,"]],[4117,["you can, I call them grass eating, you can do."]],[4120,["But if you have say, you are a left sided person,"]],[4124,["then you have to take meat."]],[4125,["You see, I would say in general that"]],[4127,["Australians should not eat so much meat as they eat."]],[4130,["They eat meat too much.They should take more vegetables."]],[4134,["But Indians should eat some meat"]],[4136,["because otherwise they’ll become cowards."]],[4139,["So it is what sort of a personality it is."]],[4141,["I don’t know from where this idea has come,"]],[4143,["that vegetarianism is going to take to God."]],[4146,["In India most of the people are vegetarians"]],[4148,["because they can’t afford it, you see."]],[4150,["No, no, no, I don't care about that vegetarianism to take to God..."]],[4154,["Now, yes, but it is not important for everyone. What I’m saying,"]],[4158,["as it is, we have to understand, we have to be discreet,"]],[4161,["we have to understand who needs what."]],[4164,["Everybody need not take vegetarian food."]],[4166,["Everybody need not take non-vegetarian food."]],[4169,["It’s the 'prakriti' they call it, nature of a person."]],[4172,["You must find out what is the nature of the person is."]],[4175,["If he, supposing he is suffering from high blood pressure,"]],[4178,["and other things like that, he has to take to food which is,"]],[4183,["which will control his, I mean which will give him another side;"]],[4188,["means he should stop eating meats and things like that."]],[4191,["All right? So he, he balances himself, to balance himself."]],[4194,["The whole food theory is to be understood through"]],[4198,["the understanding of your being first of all,"]],[4201,["what sort of a being you are,"]],[4203,["and what is lacking in you is to be supplemented."]],[4205,["So we just can’t say that,"]],[4208,["now so many people now, and doctors if you go to them they’ll say,"]],[4210,["“Cut down your sugar”, general. But it's absurd."]],[4214,["Sugar is very important for liver."]],[4216,["If you don’t take sugar I don’t know what will happen to you,"]],[4219,["you will become like sticks, you see, absolutely like sticks."]],[4222,["If those people who are right-sided,if they don’t take sugar at all,"]],[4225,["I don’t know what’s going to happen to them."]],[4227,["They'll be very irritable, hot-tempered,"]],[4229,["absolutely stick-like people.They’ll hit you like a stick, you know."]],[4233,["So that’s something, a general statement like that,"]],[4236,["is very dangerous, just not to have."]],[4238,["But what is the science behind it?"]],[4240,["Carbohydrates are very important for the body,"]],[4243,["especially if you are thinking too much,"]],[4245,["if you are a futuristic person, if you are right sided,"]],[4248,["it’s absolutely essential that you must have sufficient carbohydrates."]],[4252,["We have treated so many liver patients with sugar."]],[4255,["So this kind of a general statement even - sorry for,"]],[4258,["I must say that doctors should not feel hurt,"]],[4260,["but is a very general statement doctors also make."]],[4263,["No doubt about it, without going into it to find it,"]],[4266,["it’s very easy to say, “Now you all should stop sugars.” Why?"]],[4271,["Our forefathers ate sugars. They were healthier people than us,"]],[4275,["I tell you. All of us are sick now, this way or the other."]],[4278,["If physically you are all right, mentally we are out."]],[4280,["If we are mentally out,"]],[4282,["then we think that physically we are all right."]],[4285,["So we have a satisfaction but I think both are just the same."]],[4290,["So we have to be discreet in anything that we do."]],[4293,["It cannot be a fad, it cannot be an -ism,"]],[4296,["it cannot be a hard and fast line."]],[4299,["It's all made for you. God has made everything for you."]],[4302,["You must understand what we should eat, what will suit us."]],[4307,["That is to be found out on a person,"]],[4309,["what sort of a personality he is."]],[4311,["In our Sahaja Yoga many people take to vegetables,"]],[4315,["and many people have to take to meat eating."]],[4318,["And by that they have improved their health very much."]],[4321,["He is one who was suffering from high blood pressure,"]],[4323,["God knows how many things. He just dropped it like that."]],[4327,["And he keeps low on meats I think."]],[4334,["Do You find that today many people are more sicker, not to think of"]],[4341,["they look older, seeking the health than fifty years ago and..."]],[4347,["Do you find that more people today are sicker,"]],[4351,["in general, than they were fifty years ago?"]],[4356,["No doubt."]],[4357,["Why?"]],[4359,["Because a time has come, to see."]],[4361,["This is the time you are born for this."]],[4364,["Many children are born realised these days, so many children."]],[4367,["Now we have in our ashram about nine children, very beautiful ones,"]],[4371,["all born realised, absolutely they are."]],[4374,["You can talk to them better than you can talk to,"]],[4377,["even a very well educated person."]],[4379,["When I talk to them I just find I am just one with them."]],[4382,["So this is the time, the resurrection time,"]],[4385,["this is the time that is the Last Judgement, and that’s why"]],[4388,["so many have taken birth for their judgement, all right?"]],[4391,["No I didn't ask this kind of seeking."]],[4394,["I asked seeking the health, malaj."]],[4396,["Physically sickening."]],[4399,["She’s asking whether more people are sicker today"]],[4403,["than they were fifty years ago. But I fear if the question is obvious."]],[4406,["so I think medical science and statistics have proven this,"]],[4409,["so I don’t think there’s any question there."]],[4412,["No, no, but what’s she saying physically?"]],[4413,["You want to know why, she wants to know why"]],[4416,["Because you think they are physically sick, is it?"]],[4418,["Your judgement, no. You see they are physically sick"]],[4422,["because they have lost their roots."]],[4427,["They have gone to extremes and imbalances."]],[4431,["We cannot go to imbalance, you see."]],[4433,["Religion is to keep yourself in balance."]],[4436,["There are ten religions in the human being, like ten valencies."]],[4440,["As carbon has four valencies, we have ten valencies."]],[4444,["about which all the primordial masters"]],[4447,["who came on this earth have taught."]],[4449,["Like Lao Tze, like Socrates,"]],[4452,["we can say Abraham, Moses and many in India also."]],[4457,["They came and told us that we should keep the balance,"]],[4460,["balance our life, keep in the center for the ascent."]],[4465,["If you are not balanced you cannot ascend."]],[4468,["But people have gone to extremes. They are faddists."]],[4472,["Whatever you tell them, if you tell them that see,"]],[4475,["\"now you are not well, so you do something.\""]],[4478,["They will do it so much that they’ll outwit everything, you see."]],[4482,["They always go to the extreme of everything."]],[4485,["So, that’s how the problems are there. But doesn’t matter."]],[4490,["But moreover we are sick because we are seeking,"]],[4493,["because we are not satisfied."]],[4496,["We feel unhappy, we can’t sleep, we don’t know why we are living."]],[4503,["Is the other way round."]],[4505,["We are not seeking because we are sick,"]],[4507,["but we are sick because we are seeking."]],[4513,["Why is the Kundalini identified with female form?"]],[4518,["What?"]],[4519,["Why is Kundalini identified as a female form?"]],[4522,["Because it is the Power of God,"]],[4526,["and God is regarded as \"He\","]],[4529,["and the Kundalini as the Mother."]],[4532,["He as the Father, and the Holy Ghost as the Mother."]],[4536,["She’s the Holy Ghost."]],[4538,["So because He’s the Father, we have to have a lady with Him."]],[4541,["So we call Her the Mother."]],[4543,["And one should not feel bad about it,"]],[4545,["men should not feel bad at all because you all had a mother."]],[4549,["You could not have come on this earth without a mother."]],[4551,["You just can’t help it, that’s how the nature is."]],[4554,["You have to accept the fact."]],[4558,["Mother is a surety, isn’t it?"]],[4565,["Yes, please."]],[4567,["Just first he and then you."]],[4569,["Does Mother have a guru and"]],[4571,["what point did She gained Self-realization?"]],[4575,["Do you have a guru and at what stage"]],[4577,["did You receive Self-realization?"]],[4579,["I neither have a guru nor I want you to have a guru."]],[4582,["You better become your own gurus."]],[4585,["Secondly I’ve been born like that,"]],[4587,["I never got any realization or anything."]],[4590,["I just got realization, I should say human realization"]],[4593,["when I understood what was the problem with human beings."]],[4596,["I worked on the all permutations and combinations of human beings,"]],[4599,["because I wanted to have an en-masse media,"]],[4602,["by which I could give realization to thousands of people."]],[4605,["Because any discovery which is made and is not brought to that level"]],[4609,["it is absolutely detrimental to the growth."]],[4616,["For example, you see, Jesus was crucified. Why?"]],[4620,["Because He was alone! Only for His mother, nobody knew what He was."]],[4626,["At that time He could not achieve this,"]],[4628,["because you all were not there at the time."]],[4631,["And also other people - you know how the saints have suffered,"]],[4637,["how every prophet has suffered because"]],[4639,["because they could not create a mass understanding of it."]],[4643,["So at a certain point it has to become a mass thing."]],[4647,["In the tree of life there are only three or four"]],[4651,["flowers in the beginning, but when it grows,"]],[4654,["when the blossom time comes, then so many flowers are there"]],[4658,["and they become the fruits."]],[4661,["So I, I just saw that this is the time I have to do this job."]],[4665,["So you would call it My \"human\" realization"]],[4668,["when I understood human beings."]],[4671,["Of course even now sometimes I get shocked the way they behave,"]],[4674,["I mean, I just don’t understand, but I think now I understand them."]],[4682,["So those people who can’t quite understand that answer,"]],[4685,["don’t think about it too much."]],[4687,["There's another gentlemen who was asking a question."]],[4689,["Mother has to be somebody special, but find out for yourself."]],[4692,["That’s the best way.","You don’t worry about Me, you worry about yourself."]],[4696,["I must be someone, all right. Even if I’m not, doesn’t matter."]],[4699,["If you are going to get it, why not have it?"]],[4701,["Who? The gentlemen there. Yes, please."]],[4704,["Is that phase that You've given today, tomorrow, next day,"]],[4708,["I think on the [unclear] to call wholly"]],[4711,["or it just continues, or it stops like this."]],[4714,["No, tonight She just gave an introductory lecture."]],[4718,["Tomorrow night and the next night"]],[4720,["She will cover completely the subtle body."]],[4722,["All right."]],[4724,["The whole system."]],[4727,["But You shouldn’t come late tomorrow."]],[4732,["What if we can't get the three days?"]],[4735,["What is she saying?"]],[4736,["If you can’t get the three days and you seriously want"]],[4738,["to settle into it, the film is being taken. They'll be showing it."]],[4741,["But why are you worried? Let us see for the present."]],[4744,["Why should be in the future? You will get it. Why not?"]],[4748,["Why makes you, what makes you think,"]],[4750,["if you don’t get it, you are not going to miss it."]],[4752,["We have people here,"]],[4754,["we have luckily an ashram, a beautiful place, you’ll like it,"]],[4757,["you can go there, they will give it to you."]],[4763,["Listen, may I ask a question please?"]],[4765,["Yes."]],[4766,["What is the first step to Self-realization?"]],[4770,["What is the first step to Self-realization?"]],[4775,["There is nothing like first, second. It's not a course, you see."]],[4779,["The Kundalini, it's an awakening within us which takes place,"]],[4784,["which is like a living process. All right?"]],[4787,["So the Kundalini rises and shoots off here."]],[4790,["Now, some people feel the Kundalini wobbling down there, down below."]],[4796,["Some people feel it in the stomach."]],[4799,["Some people feel it here; some people feel it here;"]],[4803,["but most of them feel it here only, jetting out like cool breeze."]],[4807,["So you just can’t say what is the first step,"]],[4810,["depends on how it rises."]],[4814,["So, everybody doesn’t feel the same way,"]],[4816,["So I can’t say that this is the first stage. All right?"]],[4822,["Of course first you feel thoughtlessly aware."]],[4826,["You become thoughtlessly aware, first thing that should happen to you"]],[4829,["when the Kundalini crosses this center."]],[4832,["When it comes out of it, you start feeling the cool breeze here,"]],[4835,["and you start feeling the cool breeze in your hands,"]],[4838,["and you start feeling the cool breeze around."]],[4840,["That’s the second stage where it can go"]],[4844,["but some people really are so great"]],[4846,["that they become absolutely doubtlessly aware,"]],[4850,["what we call as Nirvikalpa. They achieve that."]],[4852,["Some of them are really, they are just there."]],[4854,["They are so beautifully made that they just become that."]],[4857,["There’s no question left in their mind but they become so powerful."]],[4861,["I’m amazed sometimes how they become so solid,"]],[4864,["really understanding themselves."]],[4867,["So there are some people, I've known, who are very, very great"]],[4870,["and they just start emitting vibrations,"]],[4873,["they start giving realization, they start curing people."]],[4877,["They can do it!"]],[4881,["So don’t condemn yourself in any way."]],[4884,["That’s first condition in Sahaja Yoga."]],[4887,["So should we now have realization?"]],[4890,["Those people are sitting very much behind"]],[4892,["should come in line with others, will be better idea."]],[4897,["Yes, just move in, as much as possible, nearer."]],[4903,["If you just slip your shoes off it helps you to..."]],[4906,["Yes, it is much better, because this Mother Earth helps you."]],[4910,["Better to take out your shoes, will help."]],[4916,["If some people want to sit on the ground, also it’s all right,"]],[4920,["but you should not be very far away"]],[4923,["because it’s better to attend to them. All right?"]],[4929,["If there are chairs here, yes."]],[4931,["There are plenty there."]],[4932,["Good."]],[4933,["There are plenty of chairs here."]],[4934,["The children can come here, come along, come and sit here."]],[4938,["There’s a lot of room for the children. Children are the best."]],[4943,["I’m very happy to see them here."]],[4945,["All right, come along, sit down, sit down. Please come along."]],[4949,["Look at their confidence! Sit down. Oh, great."]],[4954,["Just slip your shoes off."]],[4955,["Just slip out your shoes, all right? Great people."]],[4959,["You too, you too. Yes, please take out his shoes."]],[4963,["Just help him. You see, look at him, how he is alert."]],[4970,["There are so many children as I told you, are realised souls."]],[4974,["And we have to understand them. All right."]],[4979,["So now, you have to just put your hands towards Me like this."]],[4984,["Simple. Put your both the feet on the ground."]],[4987,["Touch the Mother Earth with your feet, just. And be relaxed."]],[4991,["You are not to do anything that will make you tense,"]],[4995,["means if you have anything tight here, or tight there just loosen it."]],[5000,["Do not tighten your body also too much, don’t push back your head,"]],[5003,["or push forward, just be in a relaxed way, sit straight."]],[5009,["Put your hands towards Me like this."]],[5011,["And as I said the first condition is,"]],[5015,["to say that “Mother I am not guilty”, at least sixteen times."]],[5020,["Is a punishment for people who feel that way."]],[5025,["Before we start, let us tell ourselves that we are not guilty,"]],[5030,["because I am talking of God Almighty."]],[5035,["He is the source of all joy,"]],[5038,["but He is the ocean of love,"]],[5041,["He’s the ocean of forgiveness,"]],[5044,["He’s the ocean of compassion."]],[5046,["And what mistakes can we commit?"]],[5049,["So don’t start with your guilt at all. You are all God’s people,"]],[5055,["you must get your realization."]],[5057,["So, just tell yourself,"]],[5059,["closing your eyes, in your heart,"]],[5062,["“Mother I am not guilty”. You say it sixteen times,"]],[5065,["is the best way, because there are sixteen petals here,"]],[5067,["and this is the center gets blocked if you feel guilty."]],[5073,["Please close your eyes, and don’t open your eyes till I tell you."]],[5077,["Now, just close your eyes, see."]],[5079,["Do you feel the cool breeze in your hand? The children?"]],[5084,["Yes, that’s it. The children are already feeling it,"]],[5086,["all born-realised. Just imagine."]],[5096,["Look at that. You should, you should have brought our children also,"]],[5101,["so sweet they are. Are you feeling?"]],[5107,["Good. You are all realised souls, that’s why you’ve come here."]],[5112,["Now, the left hand, as I said, is the power of desire,"]],[5119,["so you put it towards Me, left side."]],[5122,["That means you have to desire your realization."]],[5124,["Keep it comfortably on your lap, it’s all right."]],[5127,["Now, the right hand represents the power of action,"]],[5130,["so we have to use right hand to symbolically suggest"]],[5135,["our desire through this action."]],[5139,["First of all put your right hand - don’t open your eyes,"]],[5142,["please don’t open your eyes at any cost, that’s important."]],[5145,["Because if you open your eyes,"]],[5147,["the Kundalini won’t rise above Agnya Chakra."]],[5151,["Now put your right hand on your heart."]],[5156,["Don’t worry about anything, whether you are going to get it or not,"]],[5159,["but just put it - put little -"]],[5162,["sit little straight, you should not slouch down, yes."]],[5167,["Put your - please put it on your heart."]],[5171,["And now say in your heart that “Mother, am I the Spirit?”"]],[5177,["Ask a question."]],[5185,["Because Spirit resides in the heart."]],[5188,["Just ask a question, “Mother, am I the Spirit?”"]],[5193,["Ask three times."]],[5201,["It's cool."]],[5205,["Now put down your right hand on your stomach, on the left-hand side."]],[5211,["Now this is your guru principle, is your master principle,"]],[5214,["which has to be awakened."]],[5216,["So you say, ten times,"]],[5221,["“Mother, I am my own guru, I am my own master.”"]],[5226,["Just assert it, it's there. You just have to say it before Me."]],[5233,["“I am my own master.”"]],[5237,["If you have been to some gurus or anything,"]],[5239,["it will be all neutralised with it."]],[5243,["So just say “Mother, I am my own master.”"]],[5245,["Because these gurus, actually kill that Spirit in you,"]],[5248,["kill that principle in you."]],[5258,["Please say it ten times."]],[5268,["Now again raise your right hand to your heart."]],[5274,["And now with full confidence in yourself,"]],[5276,["because as you know, you are the temple of God,"]],[5279,["say that “Mother, I am the Spirit.”"]],[5284,["Say it twelve times, “Mother I am the Spirit.”"]],[5302,["It's on the Void. You put your hand."]],[5313,["All right. You can use the light behind Me. You put that."]],[5318,["Now, raise the same hand higher, onto the forehead."]],[5328,["We have missed one center where you had to say"]],[5332,["“Mother I’m not guilty”. Because the Spirit cannot be guilty."]],[5336,["It is sinless. But here at this point"]],[5339,["you have to say “Mother, I forgive everyone.”"]],[5343,["Now some of them said that “Mother it is difficult to forgive.”"]],[5347,["But it is a myth that you are not forgiving. It’s absolutely myth."]],[5352,["You are doing nothing to that person who has harmed you,"]],[5355,["or to those persons who have harmed you."]],[5357,["You are just harming yourself."]],[5359,["So just put your hand across,"]],[5361,["hold it tight and say “Mother, I forgive everyone.”"]],[5366,["Hold it, just press it a little bit from both the sides."]],[5369,["Hold it properly and just press it."]],[5374,["Squeeze in, I think, towards the center,"]],[5378,["so that all extremes will disappear in the center."]],[5387,["Now put this hand on top of your head,"]],[5392,["near the fontanelle bone area,"]],[5394,["where you had a very soft bone as a child."]],[5399,["Try to press it with your palm."]],[5402,["Try to press it with your palm. It’s quite heavy still."]],[5407,["At this point I can’t cross your freedom."]],[5411,["So you have to say, “Mother, I want realization,"]],[5414,["please give me realization.\""]],[5415,["You have to ask for it, otherwise I cannot force it into you."]],[5419,["Say it seven times please."]],[5431,["It's there. Still some Void."]],[5435,["Void and Agnya."]],[5440,["Now you raise the same hand for a while, on top of your head,"]],[5444,["and see if there’s a cool breeze coming in."]],[5446,["Just move it forward, backwards."]],[5452,["See if there’s a cool breeze coming out. Good? All right."]],[5456,["You can change over now. Don’t open your eyes, but change over."]],[5461,["See from the other hand. Put the right hand towards Me,"]],[5464,["and put the left hand on top of your head,"]],[5467,["and see if there’s a cool breeze coming in."]],[5486,["First you will feel it on top of your head and then in your hands."]],[5519,["You can always change your hand and see."]],[5522,["Once this hand, once that hand."]],[5524,["But don’t open your eyes. But put the other hand towards Me."]],[5535,["It’s very cool."]],[5574,["Now, if you have felt on your head"]],[5576,["just try to put your hands towards Me,"]],[5578,["and see that, if you are feeling it in your hands."]],[5586,["Further, you are seeing at the back, now see it in front."]],[5590,["Now in the hands you might feel it, just try in your hands."]],[5603,["You may raise your hands high, up like this. You can open your eyes"]],[5606,["and raise your hands like this. And ask a question,"]],[5610,["that, “Is this the power of God?"]],[5613,["Is this the power of Holy Ghost?"]],[5618,["Is this the cool breeze of the Holy Ghost?” Just ask the question."]],[5638,["Are you feeling it? Something happening in the fingers,"]],[5641,["You’ll feel very relaxed, first of all. Extremely relaxed."]],[5648,["All right? Now just see if it is happening."]],[5659,["In your hands. Just see in your hands. Put them back."]],[5663,["All right? Is there now? Not yet?"]],[5668,["How many of you are feeling the cool breeze in the head?"]],[5671,["Please raise your hands. It's good?"]],[5675,["And in the hands?"]],[5679,["Only in the hands. All right, it will work out."]],[5684,["Now keep your eyes open."]],[5686,["I’ll tell you another way, how you can raise your own Kundalini."]],[5692,["You just watch Me and you do the same."]],[5694,["You put your left hand,"]],[5696,["near towards your Kundalini like this, while sitting down."]],[5699,["Let’s see. Now, sit little erect, all right?"]],[5703,["Now. And then, this right hand is to be used like this,"]],[5707,["you put the right hand across,"]],[5709,["front, below, back, up. Like that."]],[5714,["You move the right hand like this."]],[5720,["Just start moving it. Now bring it higher, over your head,"]],[5725,["put it high, and just turn it, give it a twist and tie it up."]],[5732,["Try again please. Put this hand in front like this,"]],[5738,["with the right hand you start moving in this manner,"]],[5742,["which is a clockwise manner."]],[5744,["Just start moving, move it properly, that’s very important."]],[5747,["Keep one hand steadily moving."]],[5749,["Now give it a twist again and one other knot."]],[5753,["There are three powers, so for the third power we give three knots,"]],[5757,["not putting down our hands. Now let’s do again."]],[5766,["Now put it up. Tie it up once, you don’t put down the hands."]],[5771,["Again, give it a twist,"]],[5775,["knot, another one, nicely."]],[5780,["Now see if you are feeling the cool breeze."]],[5795,["Feeling?"]],[5799,["You can open your eyes."]],[5807,["Now more people must be feeling cool breeze in their heads."]],[5810,["It's so high as that, some people are feeling, yes, too."]],[5813,["You can feel it higher, lower, anywhere. Just see."]],[5821,["If you don’t feel it you have to say,"]],[5823,["“Please give me realisation Mother”, that’s all."]],[5826,["You have to ask for it, that’s all, with your full heart."]],[5831,["It’s there. All right? Good. Just ask for it."]],[5836,["Just for the asking, because that’s your own right."]],[5842,["All right? All the children have got it; beautifully."]],[5847,["So may God bless you all."]],[5850,["I’ll be here tomorrow again,"]],[5852,["and I’ll tell you about the imbalances we have, how we create them,"]],[5857,["how to get over them."]],[5859,["In two lectures I hope I’ll be able to cover lot of things."]],[5864,["But as you know, knowledge is like an ocean,"]],[5867,["and I don’t know how many lectures so far I have given,"]],[5871,["thousands, and so many are on the tape,"]],[5875,["and you can listen to them,"]],[5877,["about various dimensions of our Spirituality."]],[5881,["What is the Spirit, how it manifests,"]],[5885,["what is the creation, everything is there."]],[5888,["You can come to our ashram, which is a very beautiful place,"]],[5892,["and can listen to it, you can borrow from them"]],[5896,["and enjoy it for yourself."]],[5899,["Tomorrow I hope to see you again, and day after,"]],[5902,["so I establish this realization with you."]],[5906,["I would request you to bring some salt, sugar and water tomorrow,"]],[5911,["which I can vibrate for you, which will be a good thing to take."]],[5917,["Just bring little bit not much is needed, just to vibrate."]],[5921,["Thank you very much."]],[5932,["I think tonight we’ll let Mother go home. She’s had a long day."]],[5937,["And take the chance of meeting Her tomorrow night…"]],[5940,["I’ll meet everyone, individually, tomorrow,"]],[5942,["because today they fixed Me up with everything,"]],[5945,["television, radio, this, that. I was rushing everywhere, you see,"]],[5950,["and, I came in the morning by plane and you know what it is like."]],[5954,["So if you could excuse Me today,"]],[5957,["tomorrow I'll be definitely here for a longer period,"]],[5960,["and I’ll meet all of you individually."]],[5962,["And also if you have any questions,"]],[5964,["it’s better that you write them down in a paper and bring it here."]],[5969,["Another thing I would suggest,"]],[5970,["that you must take the books, if you got the books."]],[5972,["Yes."]],[5973,["Books, but don’t read them tonight"]],[5975,["because again your head will be off."]],[5978,["But you can take the photograph, and"]],[5982,["you can put your hands towards the photograph"]],[5985,["with a light before it. Because photograph has got vibrations."]],[5988,["It has the same coefficient, it gives vibrations."]],[5990,["Luckily, you see, very good."]],[5992,["So if you put your left hand toward the photograph,"]],[5995,["first, with a light,"]],[5997,["you will start gradually feeling the cool breeze,"]],[6000,["right hand outside like that,"]],[6001,["you see like an outlet given."]],[6004,["The whole thing that’s wrong there, passes out of this hand."]],[6007,["Then you put your right hand towards the photograph,"]],[6009,["and the left hand outside."]],[6011,["At this time, before sleeping if you do it,"]],[6014,["you can have a little basin of water,"]],[6018,["in which you can put some salt,"]],[6020,["and put your feet in it so the water sucks in problems within you."]],[6025,["It’s very interesting to use all the five elements."]],[6027,["We are using light,"]],[6029,["we can use the water, every sort of thing is to be used,"]],[6033,["just to give us proper balance."]],[6035,["So, I hope you take the photograph and do the needful tonight."]],[6040,["And don’t discuss about it, talk about it,"]],[6042,["because you cannot understand it with this limited brain."]],[6045,["It’s an unlimited space where you have gone."]],[6048,["Thank you very much. May God bless you."]],[6055,["As you leave tonight, for those people who would like to follow it up"]],[6060,["we are very happy to let you know, where we meet each week,"]],[6064,["so that you could learn about Kundalini,"]],[6067,["about the chakras and develop your realization."]],[6071,["So give to the person standing at the back"]],[6074,["your address and your telephone number."]],[6075,["Why don’t you tell them address now? No harm."]],[6077,["No, certainly."]],[6078,["And the telephone number it's better if you write it down."]],[6083,["Also give your name, but also..."]],[6086,["We have the ashram, the center is at 1267 Burke Road Kew."]],[6092,["Again."]],[6093,["1267 Burke Road Kew."]],[6097,["Is it very easy to get to the road,"]],[6099,["there's two tram stop practically on the doorstep."]],[6102,["However, that address is written"]],[6105,["or it's stamped on the bottom of a sheet"]],[6107,["that is enclosed in the little booklet that we have"]],[6109,["at the back of the hall. Our phone number also is there."]],[6112,["It's 801696. You’re very welcome to come and see us."]],[6117,["On Sunday as at the moment we’re planning to have a workshop,"]],[6122,["where you are all welcome to come and spend time with Mother,"]],[6125,["and She will be able to talk to you more closely and"]],[6128,["show you in more practical ways how Sahaja Yoga,"]],[6132,["how this Kundalini awakening can work within you."]],[6136,["When Mother said \"bring salt sugar and water\", it's to bring"]],[6141,["a small quantity of those particular substances because they can act"]],[6145,["upon our subtle body because they embody some of the essences"]],[6150,["that we have within ourselves. Just a small quantity"]],[6153,["in an opened packet, you know, so that it's easy, easy to reach, ok?"]],[6155,["Plastic bag or something."]],[6158,["Take the addresses then."]],[6160,["Oh, yes. And just for your own sake as much as anything,"]],[6165,["what often happens is, you know, it's quite hard to even comprehend"]],[6170,["what's gone on this evening, ok."]],[6172,["You’ve come along, you've been given realization and you know"]],[6178,["it’s way beyond our own comprehension as to what's really happened"]],[6181,["and it's so easy to go away and think, \"Oh, no, no."]],[6185,["They were telling me stories. It couldn’t possibly be true.\""]],[6188,["It is true, believe it. We can help you find that out,"]],[6192,["and establish it within yourself and just to help you,"]],[6196,["if you can give us your names and addresses."]],[6198,["I’m certainly not forcing you to do it or anything like that"]],[6201,["but if you can do that, then we can keep in touch with you"]],[6204,["and help you establish it further."]],[6206,["One instant God. I mean afterall, you must know that sometimes,"]],[6211,["it may take little time. Of course, it works instantly,"]],[6214,["but if something wrong inside then it takes time."]],[6217,["So give more time to yourself, little patience with yourself,"]],[6220,["as I have patience with you."]],[6222,["You must have some patience with yourself"]],[6224,["and just try to understand that this has to work out."]],[6228,["That’s very important."]],[6230,["If it has not worked out, it will have to be worked out."]],[6233,["May God bless you."]]]);
